Android port: Mys12word (@Mys12word) with DeepSeek.

Modifications for the Android port:
- added apps/mobile/ (Node host, Electron/better-sqlite3 shims, HTTP+WebSocket bridge,
  mobile renderer entry, on-device folder picker, PWA assets, build scripts)
- added apk/ and tools/apk/ (WebView shell + on-device APK build toolchain)
- refactored the renderer API surface into apps/desktop/client/shell/preload/api.ts
- added a phone layout and touch-oriented styles to the shared React UI
- added ORISON_PROJECTS_ROOT support to the desktop path guard
- replaced orison-file:// URLs with an HTTP equivalent for the web host

Bundled components:
- Node.js runtime (MIT) — https://nodejs.org
- Material Symbols (Apache-2.0), React (MIT), TipTap (MIT), isomorphic-git (MIT),
  mammoth (BSD-2-Clause), turndown (MIT), pino (MIT)

Full dependency licenses are available from each package in the pnpm store.

The prebuilt APK is distributed as a GitHub Release asset and is signed with a
locally generated development key.
